#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:5
msgid "Reinforcement Learning"
msgstr "强化学习"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:7
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab provides a common workflow for training and evaluating policies "
"with several reinforcement learning (RL) libraries. This page helps you "
"choose a library, run your first experiment, and understand the options you "
"are most likely to use."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 为多个强化学习（RL）库提供统一的策略训练和评估流程。本页帮助你选择库、运行首个实验，并了解最常用的选项。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:12
msgid ""
"If you are starting a new robotics project and do not need a feature unique "
"to another library, start with **RSL-RL**."
msgstr "如果正在开始一个新的机器人项目，且不需要其他库的独有功能，建议从 **RSL-RL** 开始。"

