msgstr "运行命令时，选择对应的 ``uv`` extra 来安装可选依赖："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:102
msgid "Typical training workflow"
msgstr "典型训练流程"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:104
msgid ""
"Before committing to a long run, verify the environment and the complete "
"training path with small smoke tests."
msgstr "开始长时间训练前，先用小规模冒烟测试验证环境和完整训练路径。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:107
msgid "First, check that the task resets and steps without an RL library:"
msgstr "首先，不使用强化学习库，检查任务能否正常重置和步进："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:113
msgid ""
"Then run a few training iterations on a limited number of environments:"
msgstr "然后，在少量环境上运行几次训练迭代："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:120
msgid ""
"If both commands succeed, remove the smoke-test overrides and use the task's"
" tuned defaults."
msgstr "两个命令都成功后，移除冒烟测试的覆盖参数，使用任务调好的默认值。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:124
msgid "Monitor training"
msgstr "观察训练"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:126
msgid "Start TensorBoard in a second terminal:"
msgstr "在另一个终端启动 TensorBoard："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:132
msgid "Focus on trends across multiple iterations:"
msgstr "关注多次迭代中的趋势："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Mean reward** should generally improve, although its absolute value is "
"task-specific."
msgstr "**平均奖励** 通常应逐步提高，但其绝对值取决于任务。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:136
msgid ""
"**Mean episode length** depends on the task. Longer episodes are useful for "
"a balance task but not necessarily for a goal-completion task."
msgstr "**平均回合长度** 取决于任务。平衡任务中较长回合通常有益，但目标完成任务未必如此。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:138
msgid ""
"**Throughput** helps identify systems bottlenecks after changes to the "
"number of environments, sensors, or rendering."
msgstr "**吞吐量** 有助于在调整环境数量、传感器或渲染后识别系统瓶颈。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:140
msgid ""
"**Losses, entropy, KL divergence, and action standard deviation** help "
"reveal unstable updates or stalled exploration. Exact metric names vary by "
"library."
msgstr "**损失、熵、KL 散度和动作标准差** 有助于发现更新不稳定或探索停滞。具体指标名称因库而异。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:144
msgid "Evaluate a policy"
msgstr "评估策略"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:146
msgid "Use ``play`` with one of the following checkpoint selectors:"
msgstr "使用 ``play`` ，并选择下列检查点选择器之一："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:152
msgid "Selector"
msgstr "选择器"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:153
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:154
msgid "``latest``"
msgstr "``latest``"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:155
msgid ""
"Loads the highest-step checkpoint from the newest compatible local run."
msgstr "从最新的兼容本地运行中，加载步数最高的检查点。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:156
msgid "``best``"
msgstr "``best``"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:157
msgid ""
"Loads the best or final checkpoint when the library records one, and "
"otherwise falls back to ``latest``."
msgstr "如果库记录了最佳或最终检查点，则加载它；否则回退到 ``latest`` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:159
msgid "``pretrained``"
msgstr "``pretrained``"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:160
msgid "Downloads a published checkpoint for a supported task and backend."
msgstr "为受支持的任务和后端下载已发布检查点。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:161
msgid "``/path/to/checkpoint``"
msgstr "``/path/to/checkpoint``"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:162
msgid "Loads a specific checkpoint."
msgstr "加载指定检查点。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:164
msgid "For example, play the best local checkpoint and record a short video:"
msgstr "例如，运行最佳本地检查点并录制短视频："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:173
msgid ""
"``play`` applies the environment config's ``play_mode()`` method: it caps "
"the scene at 50 environments and disables observation noise or corruption, "
"depending on the workflow. Override that method on a task config to "
"customize playback."
msgstr ""
"``play`` 会调用环境配置的 ``play_mode()`` 方法，将场景限制为最多 50 "
"个环境，并根据工作流程禁用观测噪声或扰动。可在任务配置中覆盖该方法，自定义回放行为。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:181
msgid "Pretrained checkpoints"
msgstr "预训练检查点"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:183
msgid ""
"Published pretrained checkpoints are available only for supported core "
"tasks, and availability may vary by RL library and backend combination. "
"Other registered tasks, including contributed tasks, are not covered by the "
"published checkpoint set."
msgstr "已发布的预训练检查点仅覆盖受支持的核心任务，可用性还可能因强化学习库和后端组合而异。其他已注册任务（包括贡献任务）不在发布的检查点集合中。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:188
msgid ""
"Pass ``--checkpoint pretrained`` to load the published policy matching the "
"resolved task configuration. The selector does not guarantee that an "
"artifact exists for every registered task: if the matching artifact has not "
"been published, the command reports that it is unavailable and exits. In "
"that case, train the task locally and use ``latest`` or an explicit "
"checkpoint path."
msgstr ""
"传入 ``--checkpoint pretrained`` "
"，加载与解析后任务配置匹配的已发布策略。该选择器不保证每个已注册任务都有对应文件；如果匹配文件尚未发布，命令会报告不可用并退出。此时请在本地训练任务，再使用"
" ``latest`` 或明确的检查点路径。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:194
msgid ""
"Maintainers can generate the preferred core-task checkpoint matrix with "
"``scripts/tools/train_and_publish_checkpoints.py``. Use ``--list --all "
"--core`` to list the tasks and backend combinations targeted for publication"
" by the current source tree. This matrix is not a live check of the remote "
"asset store; a listed combination becomes usable with ``--checkpoint "
"pretrained`` only after its checkpoint has been uploaded."
msgstr ""
"维护者可以使用 ``scripts/tools/train_and_publish_checkpoints.py`` 生成推荐的核心任务检查点矩阵。通过"
" ``--list --all --core`` "
"，可列出当前源代码计划发布的任务和后端组合。该矩阵不会实时检查远程资产存储；只有检查点上传后，列出的组合才能通过 ``--checkpoint "
"pretrained`` 使用。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:207
msgid "Resume training"
msgstr "恢复训练"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:209
msgid "Resume from the latest compatible checkpoint:"
msgstr "从最新兼容检查点恢复："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:216
msgid ""
"When loading an explicit checkpoint, use the same task, agent, ML framework,"
" and observation/action presets used during training. A checkpoint stores "
"policy state; it cannot make incompatible observations or actions "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"加载明确指定的检查点时，应使用训练时相同的任务、智能体、机器学习框架和观测/动作预设。检查点保存策略状态，无法让不兼容的观测或动作变得兼容。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:221
msgid "Configure an experiment"
msgstr "配置实验"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:223
msgid ""
"Each task registers one or more agent configurations for the libraries it "
"supports. Start from the closest maintained configuration under "
"``source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/<task-family>/.../agents/`` instead "
"of creating one from scratch."
msgstr ""
"每个任务为其支持的库注册一个或多个智能体配置。建议从 ``source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/<task-"
"family>/.../agents/`` 下最接近、持续维护的配置开始，而不是从零编写。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:229
msgid "Discover tasks and agents"
msgstr "查找任务和智能体"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:231
msgid ""
"List registered tasks, then inspect the task-specific help. The list "
"includes an RL Libraries column, since each task supports only the libraries"
" it registers a config for:"
msgstr "先列出已注册的任务，再查看任务专用帮助。列表包含 RL Libraries 列，因为每个任务只支持其已注册配置的强化学习库："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:239
msgid ""
"Use ``--agent`` to select an alternate registered configuration. For "
"example:"
msgstr "通过 ``--agent`` 选择其他已注册配置。例如："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:247
msgid "Agent configuration formats are library-specific:"
msgstr "智能体配置格式因库而异："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:249
msgid ""
"RSL-RL uses Python configuration classes derived from "
"``RslRlBaseRunnerCfg``."
msgstr "RSL-RL 使用继承 ``RslRlBaseRunnerCfg`` 的 Python 配置类。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:251
msgid ""
"RL-Games, skrl, and Stable-Baselines3 use library-specific dictionaries or "
"YAML files."
msgstr "RL-Games、skrl 和 Stable-Baselines3 使用各库特有的字典或 YAML 文件。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:253
msgid "RLinf uses a dedicated VLA post-training configuration."
msgstr "RLinf 使用专门的 VLA 后训练配置。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:255
msgid ""
"When a task offers multiple observation or action presets, choose an agent "
"whose network matches the selected preset."
msgstr "任务提供多种观测或动作预设时，应选择网络与所选预设匹配的智能体。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:260
msgid ""
"If you omit ``--rl_library``, ``train`` and ``play`` load the task's "
"registered ``default_agent``. Most core tasks default to RSL-RL; the multi-"
"agent Pendulum task defaults to skrl."
msgstr ""
"省略 ``--rl_library`` 时， ``train`` 和 ``play`` 加载任务注册的 ``default_agent`` "
"。大多数核心任务默认使用 RSL-RL；多智能体 Pendulum 任务默认使用 skrl。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:265
msgid "Override configuration with Hydra"
msgstr "通过 Hydra 覆盖配置"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:267
msgid ""
"Hydra allows you to override environment and agent configurations after the "
"regular command-line options:"
msgstr "Hydra 允许在常规命令行选项后覆盖环境和智能体配置："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:277
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/features/hydra` for quoting rules, list values, and "
"multirun sweeps."
msgstr "引号规则、列表值和多次运行的参数扫描，见 :doc:`/source/features/hydra` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:280
msgid "Select backends and presets"
msgstr "选择后端和预设"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:282
msgid ""
"Tasks can expose named selectors for physics, rendering, observations, "
"actions, and other domains. Append selectors without leading dashes:"
msgstr "任务可为物理、渲染、观测、动作及其他领域提供命名选择器。将不带前导短横线的选择器附加到命令后："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:294
msgid ""
"Not every task supports every backend. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets` for the presets declared by a "
"task."
msgstr "并非每个任务都支持所有后端。任务声明的预设见 :doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:300
msgid ""
"Use the same physics, renderer, domain, and observation/action presets for "
"training and playback. Changing an observation or action preset can change "
"the policy architecture and cause checkpoint shape errors. This is a feature"
" and reflects that the selected configuration defines the policy contract."
msgstr ""
"训练和回放应使用相同的物理、渲染器、领域及观测/动作预设。改变观测或动作预设可能改变策略架构，导致检查点形状错误。这是预期行为，反映了所选配置对策略接口的约定。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:306
msgid "Scale training"
msgstr "扩大训练规模"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:308
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab collects experience from many environments in parallel. "
"``--num_envs`` controls the number of simulation instances. Increasing it "
"can improve sample collection until simulation cost, optimizer structure, or"
" GPU memory becomes the bottleneck. Use ``--num_envs`` to scale up or down "
"as needed, but recognize that more environments do not always make training "
"faster."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 从多个并行环境收集经验。 ``--num_envs`` "
"控制仿真实例数量。增大该值可提高采样速度，直到仿真开销、优化器结构或显存成为瓶颈。可按需通过 ``--num_envs`` "
"扩大或缩小规模，但更多环境不一定使训练更快。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:314
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab also supports distributed training for RSL-RL, RL-Games, and skrl."
" See :doc:`/source/features/multi_gpu` for details on scaling training "
"across multiple GPUs."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 还支持 RSL-RL、RL-Games 和 skrl 的分布式训练。跨多 GPU 扩展训练的详情见 "
":doc:`/source/features/multi_gpu` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:319
msgid "Specialized workflows"
msgstr "专用工作流程"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:321
msgid ""
"The standard training workflow is sufficient for most tasks. The following "
"workflows are useful when transferring an existing policy, training multiple"
" agents, using JAX, or post-training a vision-language-action model."
msgstr "标准训练流程足以满足大多数任务。以下流程适用于迁移已有策略、训练多个智能体、使用 JAX 或对视觉-语言-动作模型进行后训练。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:326
msgid "RSL-RL distillation"
msgstr "RSL-RL 蒸馏"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:328
msgid ""
"Distillation transfers behavior from a trained *teacher* policy to a "
"*student* policy. The student learns to reproduce the teacher's actions, "
"often using a different observation set or a smaller network. This is useful"
" when the teacher uses information that will not be available at deployment "
"time. For example, you can train a state-based policy and distill it to a "
"vision-based policy."
msgstr ""
"蒸馏将行为从训练好的 *教师* 策略传递到 *学生* "
"策略。学生学习复现教师的动作，通常使用不同的观测集合或更小的网络。当教师使用的信息在部署时无法获得，这种方法很有用。例如，可以先训练基于状态的策略，再将其蒸馏为基于视觉的策略。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:334
msgid "First, train the teacher:"
msgstr "首先训练教师："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:341
msgid ""
"Then select the registered distillation agent and load the teacher "
"checkpoint:"
msgstr "然后选择已注册的蒸馏智能体，并加载教师检查点："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:350
msgid ""
"The task and distillation configuration determine which observations are "
"available to the teacher and student. Make sure the checkpoint was produced "
"by a compatible teacher configuration."
msgstr "任务和蒸馏配置决定教师与学生可获得的观测。请确保检查点由兼容的教师配置生成。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:355
msgid "skrl multi-agent training"
msgstr "skrl 多智能体训练"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:357
msgid ""
"Multi-agent reinforcement learning trains multiple agents that act in the "
"same environment. skrl supports two common approaches:"
msgstr "多智能体强化学习训练多个在同一环境中行动的智能体。skrl 支持两种常用方法："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:360
msgid ""
"**MAPPO** uses information from all agents while training the value "
"function, but allows each agent to act from its own observations at runtime."
" This centralized-training, decentralized-execution approach can help agents"
" learn coordinated behavior."
msgstr ""
"**MAPPO** 在训练价值函数时使用所有智能体的信息，但运行时各智能体仅根据自身观测行动。这种集中训练、分散执行的方法有助于学习协调行为。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:365
msgid ""
"**IPPO** trains each agent independently. It is simpler and provides a "
"useful baseline, but it does not explicitly use information from the other "
"agents during optimization."
msgstr "**IPPO** 独立训练各智能体。它更简单，是实用的基线，但优化时不会显式使用其他智能体的信息。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:369
msgid "For example, train the Shadow Hand handover task with MAPPO:"
msgstr "例如，使用 MAPPO 训练 Shadow Hand 物体交接任务："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:377
msgid ""
"Use ``--algorithm IPPO`` to run the corresponding independent-policy "
"workflow. The selected task must expose a multi-agent interface supported by"
" the algorithm."
msgstr "通过 ``--algorithm IPPO`` 运行对应的独立策略流程。所选任务必须提供算法支持的多智能体接口。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:382
msgid "skrl training with JAX"
msgstr "使用 JAX 进行 skrl 训练"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:384
msgid ""
"skrl can also train policies with JAX instead of PyTorch. This is useful "
"when integrating with a JAX-based learning stack or experimenting with JAX "
"compilation and execution:"
msgstr "skrl 也可以使用 JAX 代替 PyTorch 训练策略，适合接入基于 JAX 的学习系统，或试验 JAX 编译与执行："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:396
msgid ""
"The ``skrl-jax`` extra installs JAX with CUDA 13 support and the skrl JAX "
"dependencies. Use it instead of the ``skrl`` extra for this workflow."
msgstr ""
"``skrl-jax`` 可选依赖组会安装支持 CUDA 13 的 JAX 和 skrl 的 JAX 依赖。在此工作流程中，应使用它替代 "
"``skrl`` 可选依赖组。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:399
msgid ""
"JAX preallocates GPU memory by default, so ensure that the simulation and "
"learner can share the available memory. See the `skrl installation guide "
"<https://skrl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/intro/installation.html>`__ and the "
"`JAX installation guide "
"<https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/installation.html>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"JAX 默认会预分配 GPU 显存，因此需要确认可用显存能同时满足仿真和学习器的需求。更多信息见 `skrl 安装指南 "
"<https://skrl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/intro/installation.html>`__ 和 `JAX "
"安装指南 <https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/installation.html>`__。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:406
msgid "RLinf VLA post-training"
msgstr "RLinf VLA 后训练"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:408
msgid ""
"Vision-language-action (VLA) models map visual observations and language "
"instructions to robot actions. RLinf uses reinforcement learning to adapt a "
"pretrained VLA model to a task, improving its behavior using task rewards "
"rather than demonstrations alone."
msgstr ""
"视觉-语言-动作（VLA）模型将视觉观测和语言指令映射为机器人动作。RLinf 使用强化学习，将预训练 VLA "
"模型适配到具体任务，通过任务奖励而不只是示范数据改善其行为。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:413
msgid ""
"Provide an RLinf experiment configuration and the base model to post-train:"
msgstr "提供 RLinf 实验配置和待后训练的基础模型："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:421
msgid ""
"VLA post-training typically requires substantially more GPU memory than "
"training a small policy from scratch. See :ref:`rlinf-post-training` for "
"installation, distributed execution, configuration, and evaluation."
msgstr ""
"相比从零训练小型策略，VLA 后训练通常需要更多显存。安装、分布式执行、配置和评估见 :ref:`rlinf-post-training` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:426
msgid "Programmatic use"
msgstr "通过 Python 调用"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:428
msgid ""
"Downstream applications and automated scripts can invoke the same training "
"dispatcher used by the command line. Constructing a request directly avoids "
"creating an ``argparse.Namespace`` and provides a stable interface for "
"launching training from Python:"
msgstr ""
"下游应用和自动化脚本可以调用与命令行相同的训练分发器。直接构造请求无需创建 ``argparse.Namespace`` ，并为从 Python "
"启动训练提供稳定接口："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:445
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.PlaybackRequest` with "
":func:`~isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.play` for playback. Place options understood"
" by the selected RL library in ``backend_args``. Place Hydra overrides and "
"preset selectors in ``hydra_args``."
msgstr ""
"回放时，将 :class:`~isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.PlaybackRequest` 与 "
":func:`~isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.play` 配合使用。所选强化学习库理解的选项放入 ``backend_args`` "
"；Hydra 覆盖参数和预设选择器放入 ``hydra_args`` 。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:451
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:454
msgid "Out of memory"
msgstr "内存不足"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:456
msgid ""
"Reduce ``--num_envs`` first. This usually provides the largest memory "
"reduction without changing the task itself. For camera-based tasks, also "
"consider reducing the image resolution, number of captured views, rollout "
"length, or policy size."
msgstr ""
"首先减小 ``--num_envs`` "
"。这通常能在不改变任务本身的情况下最大程度降低内存用量。对于基于相机的任务，还可考虑减小图像分辨率、采集视图数量、轨迹采样长度或策略规模。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:461
msgid ""
"Disable the interactive visualizer during performance runs. Remember that "
"collision geometry, contacts, and deformable bodies consume simulation "
"memory independently of the policy and rollout buffers."
msgstr "性能测试时禁用交互式可视化器。碰撞几何、接触和可变形物体占用的仿真内存，与策略及轨迹采样缓冲区相互独立。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:465
msgid ""
"When using JAX, account for its default GPU-memory preallocation in addition"
" to the memory required by the simulation."
msgstr "使用 JAX 时，除仿真内存外，还需考虑其默认显存预分配。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:469
msgid "NaNs in observations or the policy"
msgstr "观测或策略中出现 NaN"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:471
msgid ""
"NaNs often originate in an unstable simulation or invalid reset state and "
"then propagate through the observations, rewards, and learner. Reproduce the"
" failure without training when possible, and locate the first value that "
"becomes non-finite."
msgstr "NaN 通常源于不稳定的仿真或无效重置状态，随后传播到观测、奖励和学习器中。尽可能在不训练的情况下复现故障，并定位第一个变为非有限值的量。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:476
msgid "Check:"
msgstr "请检查："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:478
msgid "reset joint positions, velocities, and object poses;"
msgstr "重置时的关节位置、速度和物体位姿；"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:479
msgid "actuator gains, limits, and action scaling;"
msgstr "执行器增益、限制和动作缩放；"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:480
msgid "contact geometry, masses, inertias, and unexpectedly large impulses;"
msgstr "接触几何、质量、惯量及异常大的冲量；"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:481
msgid "the physics time step, substeps, and solver iterations; and"
msgstr "物理时间步长、子步数和求解器迭代次数；以及"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:482
msgid ""
"reward or observation terms containing unsafe division, normalization, or "
"square roots."
msgstr "包含不安全除法、归一化或平方根运算的奖励和观测项。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:485
msgid ""
"Fix the invalid state or calculation rather than masking the problem by "
"clamping every policy input. Then repeat the training smoke test."
msgstr "修复无效状态或计算，而不是通过截断全部策略输入来掩盖问题。然后重新执行训练冒烟测试。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:489
msgid "Training is stable but does not learn"
msgstr "训练稳定，但没有学会任务"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:491
msgid "Verify the environment contract before tuning hyperparameters:"
msgstr "调整超参数前，先验证环境接口约定："

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:493
msgid "actions control the intended joints;"
msgstr "动作控制了预期关节；"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:494
msgid "observations change as the environment changes;"
msgstr "观测随环境变化而变化；"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:495
msgid "rewards increase when the agent makes progress; and"
msgstr "智能体取得进展时，奖励增加；以及"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:496
msgid "terminations and resets occur under the expected conditions."
msgstr "终止和重置在预期条件下发生。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:498
msgid ""
"Compare the configuration with the closest maintained task, then change one "
"factor at a time. For each experiment, record the task, RL library, physics "
"backend, domain presets, seed, number of environments, agent configuration, "
"and Hydra overrides. Without this information, apparently small "
"configuration differences can be mistaken for algorithmic regressions."
msgstr ""
"与最接近、持续维护的任务配置对照，然后每次只改变一个因素。各实验都应记录任务、强化学习库、物理后端、领域预设、种子、环境数量、智能体配置和 Hydra "
"覆盖参数。缺少这些信息时，看似细微的配置差异可能被误判为算法性能退化。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:505
msgid "Checkpoint does not load"
msgstr "检查点无法加载"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:507
msgid ""
"Verify that the playback or resumed-training command uses the same RL "
"library, task, agent configuration, ML framework, and observation and action"
" presets as the original run. Tensor-shape errors usually indicate that one "
"of these settings changed."
msgstr ""
"确认回放或恢复训练命令使用与原始运行相同的强化学习库、任务、智能体配置、机器学习框架和观测/动作预设。张量形状错误通常意味着其中一项发生了变化。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:512
msgid ""
"Prefer the ``latest`` or ``best`` checkpoint selectors when available. "
"Manifest discovery filters incompatible runs before attempting to load their"
" checkpoints."
msgstr "可用时优先使用 ``latest`` 或 ``best`` 检查点选择器。清单发现机制会在尝试加载检查点前过滤不兼容的运行。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:517
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

