msgid ""
":ref:`tutorial-run-rl-training` explains how an Isaac Lab environment is "
"wrapped for an RL library."
msgstr ":ref:`tutorial-run-rl-training` 解释如何为强化学习库包装 Isaac Lab 环境。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:522
msgid ""
":ref:`tutorial-configure-rl-training` walks through registering and "
"selecting agent configurations."
msgstr ":ref:`tutorial-configure-rl-training` 逐步介绍智能体配置的注册和选择。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:525
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/features/hydra` covers command-line overrides and sweeps."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/features/hydra` 介绍命令行覆盖和参数扫描。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:527
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/features/multi_gpu` covers multi-GPU and multi-node training."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/features/multi_gpu` 介绍多 GPU 和多节点训练。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:529
msgid ":doc:`/source/how-to/reproducibility` covers reproducible experiments."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/how-to/reproducibility` 介绍如何开展可复现的实验。"

#: source/concepts/reinforcement_learning.rst:531
msgid ""
":doc:`/source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames` covers image-observation "
"diagnostics."
msgstr ":doc:`/source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames` 介绍图像观测的诊断方法。"

